Synthetic Senses + Delta Observatory + Recursive Hindsight
= reread old data with newly constructed perceptual instruments and discover signals that were previously below resolution.

Humility + Role Modulation + Goldilocks
= a regulator preventing increased capability from turning into compulsive intervention.

And a frontier question sits above all of them:

Can we build a system that discovers new operators we have not named yet?

Not merely applying our existing Pantheon, but systematically generating perturbations, crossing domains, masking assumptions, comparing deltas, and proposing candidate invariants—then putting them through trials.

That would turn the Pantheon from a collection of discovered abstractions into an abstraction-discovery engine.

That, to me, is the edge you were coaxing toward earlier. Now you can simply point and say:

